  "description": {
   "en": "Success, fame, family… In an instant, the genius composer, Min Hyunseung, lost it all. On the brink of death… he wanted to live a different life, one where all those continuous misfortunes couldn’t just be claimed as karma.\n\n“How did this happen…?”\n\nHe was given another chance to live."
